WEBVTT

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:10.643
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Most people think that there are no dangerous animals in the UK.

00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:17.133
Now it’s true that compared to Africa, Australia, or parts of South America,

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:21.855
where there are many more dangerous creatures like snakes and spiders,

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:24.954
wildlife in the UK is relatively safe.

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:30.701
But some creatures that live here can be dangerous,

00:00:31.877 --> 00:00:35.007
and today I’m going to tell you about the top five.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.298
So, starting in reverse order, at number five, is a snake, the adder.

00:00:47.524 --> 00:00:51.041
The adder is the only poisonous snake in the UK.

00:00:51.576 --> 00:00:57.055
They can be about one metre long, and they’re quite common in some parts of the country.

00:00:58.799 --> 00:01:04.021
They don’t normally attack people, except when people step on them by accident.

00:01:05.001 --> 00:01:09.731
A bite from an adder can be very painful, and, occasionally, can kill.

00:01:12.118 --> 00:01:16.964
However, the last death from an adder bite was more than 40 years ago.

00:01:18.665 --> 00:01:20.145
So, to number four.

00:01:21.429 --> 00:01:26.084
The fourth most dangerous animal in the UK, you may be surprised to hear,

00:01:26.798 --> 00:01:27.710
is cows.

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:32.524
People think cows are slow and a bit stupid,

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:37.189
but in fact, cows kill at least one person every year.

00:01:39.919 --> 00:01:45.295
However, nearly all attacks happen when people are walking dogs in a field of cows,

00:01:46.088 --> 00:01:49.288
and they usually happen in spring or early summer,

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:52.288
when young cows are with their mothers.

00:01:52.899 --> 00:01:54.834
So that’s when you need to be careful.

00:01:57.542 --> 00:01:59.748
In third place are red deer.

00:02:02.091 --> 00:02:06.628
These are large animals – they can weigh a hundred kilograms.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.614
You need to be especially careful in the autumn,

00:02:11.488 --> 00:02:14.268
when the male deer can get very aggressive.

00:02:14.987 --> 00:02:18.759
They also cause frequent accidents on the road by

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.273
running out in front of cars –

00:02:21.202 --> 00:02:26.820
there are about 74,000 car accidents a year which involve deer.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:33.330
The second most dangerous animal in the UK is dogs.

00:02:34.986 --> 00:02:40.180
They are responsible for around 200,000 attacks a year in the UK,

00:02:41.165 --> 00:02:43.709
and although most attacks aren’t serious,

00:02:43.965 --> 00:02:46.376
a small number actually cause death.

00:02:48.065 --> 00:02:52.185
Certain breeds of dog like German shepherds, Rottweilers,

00:02:52.503 --> 00:02:55.667
and Pit Bulls, are more aggressive than others.

00:02:56.992 --> 00:03:02.346
One reason for this is that they were traditionally hunting dogs or guard dogs.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.568
Dog attacks can happen at any time,

00:03:08.072 --> 00:03:10.762
and some dogs even attack their owners.

00:03:13.878 --> 00:03:18.453
Finally, in first place are wasps and bees.

00:03:19.397 --> 00:03:24.779
They cause more deaths in the UK than any other type of animal or insect.

00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:30.014
About five people a year die from bee or wasp stings,

00:03:30.691 --> 00:03:34.560
and it’s nearly always because they have an allergic reaction.

00:03:35.703 --> 00:03:41.944
About 25% of the population in the UK have a bee or wasp allergy,

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.655
some more serious than others.

00:03:46.301 --> 00:03:52.633
However, people are usually allergic to either bees or wasps, but not both.

00:03:53.932 --> 00:03:57.637
Bees and wasps only sting in self-defence

00:03:58.011 --> 00:03:59.356
or when they’re provoked,

00:03:59.794 --> 00:04:02.765
but wasps are more aggressive than bees.

00:04:04.021 --> 00:04:07.441
So if you ever see a wasp’s nest in your garden,

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:11.468
make sure you call a professional to come and destroy it.

00:04:12.654 --> 00:04:16.469
So now you know what to look out for if you’re in the UK.

00:04:17.544 --> 00:04:18.441
Good luck!